<title>ARGENTINA: Argentina's Ledesma 1st-half net $4.4 mln.</title>
<headline>Argentina's Ledesma 1st-half net $4.4 mln.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Period to September 30. Net $4.4 million vs n/a NOTE: The company said its first half results include an unspecified $1.5 million extraordinary loss and $2.8 million in corporate tax payments. Ledesma SAAI did not provide data for Q2 but in Q1 it reported net earnings of $2.1 million. It did not report EPS.  </p>
<p>At September 30 net worth stood at $477 million. The company reported retained earnings of $14.7 million</p>
<p>- Guillermo Haskel, Buenos Aires Newsroom, 541 318-0650</p>
</text>
